<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Something's Wrong</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">James Marriott</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Something's Wrong</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">45afJugFs63B3KaDO3pcVa</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:06.990" end="00:10.140">I've never been better, except when I lie</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.140" end="00:13.270">A brand new addiction to not asking why</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.270" end="00:16.460">As hard as it's getting, I'm forgetting to try</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.460" end="00:19.490">But who could make sense of you and I?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.490" end="00:20.990">Do I have what you don't?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.920" end="00:22.570">Could you get me alone?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.570" end="00:26.070">I'm whatever you want and I'm nothing at all</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.070" end="00:29.250">Hoping you'll tell me but scared that you might</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.250" end="00:33.370">Praying you'll take this slowly</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.370" end="00:39.610">You're unforgettable, but your name has slipped my mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.610" end="00:44.270">Make me remember this time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.270" end="00:51.440">If you want me, give me something to cry about</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.440" end="00:56.410">You can hurt me, we could have it out 'til it's early</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.410" end="01:03.280">And if you need to know that we're through</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.280" end="01:10.550">Give me all your love and we're done</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.550" end="01:13.620">Does it feel like something's wrong?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.620" end="01:16.710">Does it feel like something's off?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.710" end="01:19.960">Does it feel like something's wrong?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.960" end="01:22.810">Does it feel like something's-</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.810" end="01:25.870">Off for a moment back in my stride?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.870" end="01:29.020">You used to be pretty, I used to be nice</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.020" end="01:32.060">She says I'd look better with her at my side</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.060" end="01:35.290">But now her face is in front of mine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.290" end="01:38.600">And she's doing the most, I should give up the ghost</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.600" end="01:41.670">But how can I speak with her hand on my throat?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.670" end="01:45.010">I move my foot back, but she's stepping in time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.010" end="01:49.030">Can you not make this easy?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.030" end="01:55.410">You're undeniable until you're out of sight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.410" end="02:00.110">Should probably end it tonight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.110" end="02:07.280">If you want me, give me something to cry about</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.280" end="02:12.210">You could hurt me, we could have it out 'til it's early</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.210" end="02:18.850">And if you need to know that we're through</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.850" end="02:26.350">Give me all your love and we're done</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:26.350" end="02:29.450">Does it feel like something's wrong?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:29.450" end="02:32.560">Does it feel like something's off?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:32.560" end="02:35.890">Does it feel like something's wrong?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:35.890" end="02:38.820">Does it feel like something's off?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:38.820" end="02:42.030">Does it feel like something's wrong?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:42.030" end="02:45.230">Does it feel like something's off?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:45.230" end="02:48.290">Does it feel like something's wrong?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:48.290" end="02:51.530">Does it feel like something's off?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:51.530" end="02:54.600">Does it feel like something's wrong?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:54.600" end="02:57.730">Does it feel like something's off?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:57.730" end="03:00.940">Does it feel like something's wrong?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:00.940" end="03:04.080">Does it feel like something's off?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:04.080" end="03:07.280">Does it feel like something's wrong?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:07.280" end="03:10.450">Does it feel like something's off?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:10.450" end="03:13.600">Does it feel like something's wrong?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:13.600" end="03:17.600">Does it feel like something's-</p></div></body></tt>